Q105. Create Student Record Management System
Problem Statement
Write a C program to create a Student Record Management System that stores and displays student details.

Code
#include <stdio.h>

struct Student
{
    int roll;
    char name[50];
    float marks;
};

int main()
{
    struct Student s;

    printf("Enter Roll Number: ");
    scanf("%d", &s.roll);

    printf("Enter Name: ");
    scanf("%s", s.name);

    printf("Enter Marks: ");
    scanf("%f", &s.marks);

    printf("\n----- Student Record -----\n");
    printf("Roll Number : %d\n", s.roll);
    printf("Name        : %s\n", s.name);
    printf("Marks       : %.2f\n", s.marks);

    return 0;
}

Sample Output
Enter Roll Number: 101
Enter Name: Neha
Enter Marks: 92.5

----- Student Record -----
Roll Number : 101
Name        : Neha
Marks       : 92.50

Explanation
Uses structure to store student details.
Takes input and displays the record.

