Q107. Create Salary Management System
Problem Statement
Write a C program to calculate net salary after adding HRA and DA.

Code
#include <stdio.h>

int main()
{
    float basic, hra, da, netSalary;

    printf("Enter Basic Salary: ");
    scanf("%f", &basic);

    hra = basic * 0.20;
    da = basic * 0.10;
    netSalary = basic + hra + da;

    printf("\n----- Salary Details -----\n");
    printf("Basic Salary : %.2f\n", basic);
    printf("HRA          : %.2f\n", hra);
    printf("DA           : %.2f\n", da);
    printf("Net Salary   : %.2f\n", netSalary);

    return 0;
}

Sample Output
Enter Basic Salary: 30000

----- Salary Details -----
Basic Salary : 30000.00
HRA          : 6000.00
DA           : 3000.00
Net Salary   : 39000.00

Explanation
Calculates HRA as 20%.
Calculates DA as 10%.
Displays total salary.

Q108. Create Marksheet Generation System
Problem Statement
Write a C program to generate a marksheet with total, percentage, and grade.

Code
#include <stdio.h>

int main()
{
    int m1, m2, m3, total;
    float percentage;
    char grade;

    printf("Enter marks of 3 subjects: ");
    scanf("%d%d%d", &m1, &m2, &m3);

    total = m1 + m2 + m3;
    percentage = total / 3.0;

    if (percentage >= 90)
        grade = 'A';
    else if (percentage >= 75)
        grade = 'B';
    else if (percentage >= 60)
        grade = 'C';
    else if (percentage >= 40)
        grade = 'D';
    else
        grade = 'F';

    printf("\n----- Marksheet -----\n");
    printf("Total      : %d\n", total);
    printf("Percentage : %.2f\n", percentage);
    printf("Grade      : %c\n", grade);

    return 0;
}

Sample Output
Enter marks of 3 subjects: 85 90 95

----- Marksheet -----
Total      : 270
Percentage : 90.00
Grade      : A

Explanation
Calculates total and percentage.
Assigns grade using if-else conditions.
Displays the final marksheet.